{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And to Sarah</b> — twice in the Masorah: ולשרה אמר and ולשרה בן. For it is written here regarding Sarah, 'behold, it is for you a covering of eyes' — a hint that there will be a son to Sarah who will have a covering of eyes, as it is written, 'And it came to pass that Isaac was old and his eyes were dim from seeing.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:32.825895896Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}